## 6. How long we keep data
| Data | Kept for |
|---|---|
| Voice audio of live talks | **Not stored** (real-time only) |
| Likho messages | Not stored on our server (kept on your phone until you clear the app's data) |
| Account and profile data | While your account is active; deleted on request |
| Call records (time, length, minutes, cost) and payment records | As long as needed for billing and as required by tax/accounting law |
| Order and delivery details | As long as needed for the order, returns and legal requirements |
| Analytics and crash data | As per Firebase's retention settings (by default up to 14 months for analytics; crash data for a limited period) |

