## 7. Your choices and rights
- **Microphone, notifications, alarm, storage:** you can allow or revoke these anytime in your phone's Settings.
- **Access and correction:** you can change your name and profiles in the app (Menu → Profiles).
- **Delete your account and data:** write to us at [SUPPORT EMAIL] or on WhatsApp [WHATSAPP NUMBER] from your registered number with the subject "Delete my account". We will delete your account and personal data within **30 days**, except records we must keep by law (for example, payment and tax records).
- **Stop the monthly plan:** Menu → Minutes → "Autopay band karna hai?" (or from your UPI/Google Play subscriptions).
- Under India's **Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023**, you may have the right to access, correct and erase your personal data, to withdraw consent, and to nominate someone to exercise these rights. Contact us to use them.

---

## 8. Security
We use encryption in transit (HTTPS / secure WebRTC), store PINs only as one-way hashes, keep secret keys only on our servers, and limit who can access data. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we work hard to protect your information.

